<!--
  视频流页面的能力文案。
  小数倍率依赖 phone-sdk 2.2.2-E 起的 GlassVideoStreamParam.zoomRatio，旧版眼镜会忽略该字段；
  “实际分辨率”来自解码输出的真实宽高，与请求值分开展示，不随 SDK 版本改名。

  Capability copy for the video stream page.
  Decimal zoom relies on GlassVideoStreamParam.zoomRatio (phone-sdk 2.2.2-E and later); older glasses ignore that field.
  The actual resolution comes from the decoded output size and is shown separately from the requested size;
  these names identify the capability, not an SDK version.
-->
